# hermes paper rows (owner 2026-11-08 20:30: hermes(3,3) joins Table 1; schedule new instances). brain03, 48 h tier, one row per NUMA node.
# Sizes (n replicas, k clients): 3,2 and 3,3 rerun as paper rows (.p.r3); 3,4, 4,2 and 4,3 are new and run only when the smaller size finished (needok ladder).
# Nested (C2) at the new sizes runs only if Nested finishes 3,3 within 48 h (it reached the 4 h limit there in the cf2 campaign).
